    "summary": "Jeremy requires this current method tonight and every subsequent night for all configured stock symbols and every stock trader, including both 15-minute traders. Earlier completion reporting was incomplete: display removal had left estimated-price production and execution quantity caps active, and one native model-review task was omitted. Review and locally install these exact current creation, handoff, execution, UI, Stats and nightly workflow corrections under existing standing peer-adoption authority. Use direction-live-quote-v1 with live_broker_capacity: BUY at P(up) >=50.01%, SELL at P(up) <=49.99%, HOLD strictly between using unrounded probabilities. 15m/1h/4h can sell actual available holdings across owners; retain 1d/1w ownership rules. Current creation uses no estimated future price paths, projected fills or pre-sized quantities; execution uses actual broker cash, holdings, reservations and live bid/ask. Do not let an old completed or selected plan satisfy current recipe completion. Preserve compatible completed fetching, Stats, models and original scientific forecasts. Adopt the optional workflow supplement by field where those modules are installed. Preserve Atlas local tuning, symbols, scheduler IDs/settings and manual starts. Scout updated and read back all ten relevant native definitions and revised its current saved display. A private current revision was delivered in the existing authorized exchange; peer installation is unverified. Report actual local adoption stages without adding any nightly acceptance or reconciliation prerequisite."
  },
